            <ArticleTitle>Successful medical management of a huge left main thrombus with bilateral coronary embolization.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>806-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2459/JCM.0b013e32834cadf6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a patient with a huge nonocclusive left main thrombus without underlying angiographic coronary lesion associated with bilateral coronary embolization, which was successfully and exclusively medically treated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
